      "alt": "Starterkit STKa28",
      "text": "<h1>Arm9™ with i.MX28</h1>\n<p>The Embedded Starterkit STKa28 is an evaluation kit thoughtfully designed for embedded computing engineers. It is built around the TQMa28 platform, featuring an Arm9™ processor with the i.MX28 from NXP. This kit offers engineers the convenience of access to all functional CPU pins on module connectors, ensuring versatility in development. With its compact dimensions, it provides a well-balanced ratio between computing and graphics performance. The kit comes equipped with essential features, including IEC 61850 Stack, an extended temperature range, and 2x IEEE1588 Ethernet interfaces with L2 Switch functionality. It's an ideal choice for applications in smart metering, simple visualization, control tasks, and intelligent networks.</p>",
      "displayPopupTitle": "true",
      "linkTarget": "_self",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Mon Aug 31 2026 23:24:26 GMT+0000",
      "titleValueFromDAM": "true",
      "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/textwithimage",
      "isDecorative": "false",
